---
source: src/main.rs
expression: "render_help_snapshot(&[\"anon\"])"
---
Create temporary endpoints and tunnels (no login required)

Usage: hooklistener anon [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  create       Create a temporary anonymous endpoint
  show         Show an anonymous endpoint
  list-events  List captured events for an anonymous endpoint [aliases: events]
  show-event   Show a captured event [aliases: event]
  tunnel       Expose a local HTTP server without signing in
  claim        Claim an anonymous route into an organization
  help         Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --json               Output supported command responses or event streams as JSON
      --color <COLOR>      Styling policy for human output [default: auto] [possible values: auto,
                           always, never]
      --yes                Confirm destructive commands without an interactive prompt
      --log-level <LEVEL>  Log level [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn,
                           error]
      --log-dir <DIR>      Directory for log files
      --log-stdout         Also write logs to stdout
